  redirected here.

  🔴 The disclosureLine is REQUIRED here, and it was briefly removed.

  Gus asked for no MOB anywhere on this surface, which was right while the
  brand was going to be registered to 406 Front Desk LLC. It stopped being
  right the moment he chose MOB LLC as the registrant (2026-09-12): the 10DLC
