  comparing the two needs the bridge between them or the mismatch IS the
  finding. That is precisely why the approved Kalispell TRT page names Montana
  Laser and Medical Center.

  So this line is sender coherence, not branding. Do not strip it to tidy the
  page. If the shop ever registers under its own entity rather than MOB LLC,
